1 REM FBCS FIL-0207
2 REM CLAIM A-11.1.4.9-TR48
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 11.1.4.9 Tabla 5 l.7028-7029: "ZONEWIDTH N - For DISPLAY files, the
5 REM current zonewidth. For non-DISPLAY files, zero is returned." Same for MARGIN
6 REM (l.6993-6995). Control: a DISPLAY file reports the default zonewidth 17.
10 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0207.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, RECTYPE INTERNAL
20 ASK #1: ZONEWIDTH Z, MARGIN M
30 PRINT Z; M
40 CLOSE #1
50 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0207.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL, RECTYPE DISPLAY
60 ASK #1: ZONEWIDTH Z2
70 PRINT Z2
80 CLOSE #1
90 END
